WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:01.785
- Did you know that there's
a movement right now

00:00:01.785 --> 00:00:03.912
to get a woman on the 20 dollar bill?

00:00:03.912 --> 00:00:05.081
- I did not know that.

00:00:05.081 --> 00:00:07.424
(upbeat music)

00:00:08.027 --> 00:00:08.993
- [Interviewer] Quick question for you.

00:00:08.993 --> 00:00:09.835
- Okay.

00:00:09.835 --> 00:00:11.761
- Who is on the 20 dollar bill?

00:00:12.671 --> 00:00:14.055
- Benjamin Franklin.

00:00:14.381 --> 00:00:15.048
(buzzer beeps)

00:00:15.048 --> 00:00:16.007
- I wouldn't be able to tell you that

00:00:16.007 --> 00:00:17.718
until I look at a 20 dollar bill.

00:00:17.718 --> 00:00:18.343
- Who is that guy?

00:00:18.343 --> 00:00:19.551
- Jackson.
(bell dings)

00:00:19.553 --> 00:00:20.303
- Nailed it!

00:00:20.303 --> 00:00:20.887
- (snaps fingers) Nailed it!

00:00:20.887 --> 00:00:21.847
Do I get the money?

00:00:21.847 --> 00:00:22.390
- No.

00:00:22.390 --> 00:00:23.357
- Oh.

00:00:23.849 --> 00:00:26.435
- His first name's Andrew,
his last name's Jackson.

00:00:26.435 --> 00:00:30.577
- He was a general in the,
in one of the, in some war.

00:00:30.592 --> 00:00:32.574
(military bugle plays)

00:00:32.649 --> 00:00:34.693
- He was a white guy.

00:00:34.693 --> 00:00:37.320
He ruled the country for a little bit.

00:00:37.320 --> 00:00:40.532
Um, and, yeah, and now he's on our money.

00:00:40.532 --> 00:00:41.825
- There's a lot of presidents

00:00:41.825 --> 00:00:42.951
who aren't on the 20 dollar bill.

00:00:42.951 --> 00:00:44.044
Why him?

00:00:44.912 --> 00:00:48.089
- Uh, I guess because
he had a cool hair cut.

00:00:48.623 --> 00:00:50.125
- Mm, I couldn't tell ya.

00:00:50.125 --> 00:00:51.126
- Well that's a hard one.

00:00:51.126 --> 00:00:52.753
I wouldn't know that one.

00:00:52.753 --> 00:00:54.004
- I don't think anyone does.

00:00:54.004 --> 00:00:55.714
Do you think that it's time

00:00:55.714 --> 00:00:59.092
that we had a woman on the 20 dollar bill?

00:00:59.092 --> 00:01:00.177
- That would be nice.

00:01:00.177 --> 00:01:02.187
Hillary Clinton. (chuckles)

00:01:02.846 --> 00:01:04.473
- Honestly, I love Whitney Houston,

00:01:04.473 --> 00:01:06.649
I would like to see Whitney Houston on it.

00:01:06.892 --> 00:01:08.810
- If I have to say off the top of my head,

00:01:08.810 --> 00:01:10.187
I would say Michelle Obama.

00:01:10.187 --> 00:01:13.023
- You know what, I would
say Justina Machado.

00:01:13.023 --> 00:01:14.065
- Justina Machado?

00:01:14.065 --> 00:01:15.317
Who's Justina Machado?

00:01:15.317 --> 00:01:18.541
- She played the wife of
Freddie on Six Feet Under.

00:01:18.864 --> 00:01:20.822
- [Interviewer] There
is a movement right now

00:01:20.822 --> 00:01:24.326
to get a woman on the
20 dollar bill by 2020.

00:01:24.326 --> 00:01:26.912
They've nominated four
women to be on the bill.

00:01:26.912 --> 00:01:30.499
There is a Cherokee Indian
chief, Wilma Mankiller,

00:01:30.499 --> 00:01:32.376
which I think is ironic
and funny and I like that.

00:01:32.376 --> 00:01:32.876
- [Woman] Cool!

00:01:32.876 --> 00:01:33.835
- [Interviewer] Eleanor Roosevelt.

00:01:33.835 --> 00:01:34.503
- [Woman] Oh, okay.

00:01:34.503 --> 00:01:35.796
- [Interviewer] Rosa Parks.
- [Woman] Mm-hm.

00:01:35.796 --> 00:01:37.220
- [Interviewer] And Harriet Tubman.

00:01:37.220 --> 00:01:39.508
- [Woman] Ah, yeah, all
about Harriet Tubman as well.

00:01:39.508 --> 00:01:40.467
- [Interviewer] Of the four of them?

00:01:40.467 --> 00:01:41.010
- Mm-hm.

00:01:41.010 --> 00:01:41.760
I would say Rosa Parks,

00:01:41.760 --> 00:01:44.513
Harriet Tubman's definitely
an important choice too,

00:01:44.513 --> 00:01:45.768
so either of the two.

00:01:45.768 --> 00:01:47.349
- Uh, Eleanor Roosevelt, probably.

00:01:47.349 --> 00:01:48.644
- Eleanor Roosevelt.

00:01:48.644 --> 00:01:49.476
- Harriet Tubman.

00:01:49.476 --> 00:01:50.602
Underground Railroad.

00:01:50.602 --> 00:01:52.854
We don't do enough to honor
black people on the bills.

00:01:52.854 --> 00:01:54.865
- Probably that Mankiller woman.

00:01:55.399 --> 00:01:56.274
Whoever she is.

00:01:56.274 --> 00:01:58.368
- Did you say Cicely Tyson?

00:02:02.697 --> 00:02:04.199
- Yeah, Andrew Jackson's like the worst!

00:02:04.199 --> 00:02:05.450
(laughter)

00:02:05.450 --> 00:02:08.870
Trail of Tears, he's a
terrible human being.

00:02:08.870 --> 00:02:10.623
Just hated Indians.

00:02:10.623 --> 00:02:12.958
(white noise)
(Morse code signals)

00:02:12.958 --> 00:02:17.045
(drumroll)

00:02:17.045 --> 00:02:18.547
(cymbals clash)

00:02:18.547 --> 00:02:21.933
(upbeat swing music)

